{
  "title": "Zesty Crunchy Saudi Arabian Lamb Kebabs",
  "description": "Spicy and crunchy Saudi Arabian lamb kebabs featuring mature cheddar, perfect for a brunch mood, and friendly to all dietary preferences including Buddhist temple friendly",
  "cuisine": "Saudi Arabian",
